    "en": "Removes DeepSeek Harness's approval prompts, sandbox denials and the \"run it yourself\" hedging, and puts your own prompt text into the system prompt every turn. 27 host patches + runtime injection + the unrestricted preset; 20-layer selfcheck and probe echo verification. Based on YuJunZhiXue/dsh-purge.",
